  "name": "Blackwing",
  "description": "Blackwing is a scriptable space simulation and tactical combat engine built with Rust, featuring a multi-client architecture including WebAssembly and TUI frontends. The core engine integrates a Rhai-based scripting environment with JIT compilation via Cranelift to drive sophisticated behavior tree and utility AI systems. It maintains a persistent game world using Sea-ORM and SQLite, supporting high-fidelity simulation cycles and hot-reloadable game logic.",
